    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Provider**\n\nI've decided to use Google Cloud Text-to-Speech for synthesizing the text. I'll need to clearly identify this choice within the `synthesize_text.py` file itself to keep the code's dependence clear.\n\n\n**Implementing the Synthesis**\n\nOkay, I'm setting up the `synthesize_text.py` file now. I'm focusing on the code to synthesize text using Google Cloud Text-to-Speech. I'm importing the necessary library and setting up the client. Next, I will be defining the text, voice, and audio configurations. Then, it's just a matter of calling the synthesis method.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789867745780,
          "start": 1789867743587
        },
        "type": "reasoning"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc6e5963001gNldlem1LQ8pgB",
